# Reuse Map

The primary imports the pinned Block-13 runner only for the unchanged
84-content code, hybrid carrier, fourteen-way probability law, five-cell relay,
flag predicate, and all-or-none guard.  It implements cap geometry, complete
clear/blocked frontiers, content-blind runtime scans, composed adjudication,
and claim scope locally.

The independent imports no Source/Eta runner.  It rebuilds cubic rotations,
integer lattice geometry, the fourteen-way affine law, controller tokens,
probability/STOP groups, and scope checks using only the standard library.  Its
primary candidate generator extrapolates directed Record-adjacency edges rather
than looping over candidate directions.

Shared integer adjacency, signed coordinate directions, and exact rational
arithmetic are mathematical infrastructure, not shared Block-15 adjudication
logic.
